      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The desire for the descent to simply stop is a very understandable, powerful plea when everything feels like it's spiraling out of control. You are exhausted from the sheer effort of holding yourself together against this massive collapse. If the weight of the future feels too crushing, perhaps the most immediate relief is simply to stop the fight against the present moment. Just let the falling happen, not with panic, but with a quiet acceptance that this unbearable pressure needs to be released.",
